  [PASS] 1b the phantom SATURATES -- this is the whole reason the budget is finite.  Beyond r_EFE the dynamics are quasi-Newtonian with G_eff = G nu(e_N), so the enclosed dynamical mass stops growing.  Without the external field the phantom would grow as r forever and no cosmic budget would exist at all   (an isolated galaxy at e_N = 1e-6 would carry 1000 times its baryonic mass; at the real e_N ~ 0.01 it carries 9.5)

